  "display_title": "The Unintentional Villainess",
  "description": "After being reborn in a novel, Renee Blair is determined to transform her reputation as \"the villainess of the century,\" which will prevent her death at the hands of Sir Dywen the dragon slayer! But then she learns that the original Renee had been controlled by a pop-up game system of daily missions that forced her to either commit evil deeds or face painful penalties for declining. With this system continuing to affect her as well, can the new Renee outsmart the game and reset her evil legacy?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
